VALUES
  ('MULBERRY RED Raw Human Hair Wig Wavy', 'mulberry-red-raw-human-hair-wig-wavy', 'She is an embodiment of bold elegance. The deep and rich Mulberry hue infuses the wig with a sense of sophistication and allure. This dramatic color choice is a statement in itself, exuding confidence and an air of mystery.The Mulberry red shade complements a range of skin tones, adding warmth and vibrancy to the overall appearance. Whether worn casually or for special occasions, MULBERRY RED comm', 84122, 84500, '["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_f20fae34c31742838141c00df744c750~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_f20fae34c31742838141c00df744c750~mv2.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'wigs', 'wavy', true, false, 0, true, true, 4.7, 56),
