  ('ZAHRA PIXIE BOB Raw Human Hair Wig', 'zahra-pixie-bob-raw-human-hair-wig', 'Fierce and flattering, the ZAHRA PIXIE BOB has a natural feel, allowing you to look flawless every time you wear it. Strikingly bold, this 8” bob’s style is rich and sophisticated, upgrading your look to its most polished. Made of 100% raw human hair, it enables flawless styling with every wear allowing easy maintenance. It’s a wear and go unit.Cap construction: 13 by 4 frontal wigHead Circumferen', 38824, 38998, '["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_44888bace47247ea88a5f7f29d5d3c72~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_44888bace47247ea88a5f7f29d5d3c72~mv2.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'wigs', NULL, true, false, 0, false, false, 4.5, 69),
