  ('BOSS LADY  Raw Human Hair Wig Wavy', 'boss-lady-raw-human-hair-wig-wavy', 'Enticing and bold, the BOSS LADY is sensual and luxe with loose waves and lace front styling. Made of 100% Raw human hair, the gorgeously long and layered, 20” BOSS LADY has a sable hue that adds allure and mystique to your whole vibe.Cap construction: Lace front wigsHand knotted: 13 by 4 frontal Cap size: Small, Medium, LargeLength: from 8 to 28 inchesFiber: 100% Raw Human HairDensity: FullTextur', 58232, 58493, '["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_7e88bcb135f648589f6816284d9b5832~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_7e88bcb135f648589f6816284d9b5832~mv2.jpeg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_33970b72e7804beba3e2837e1098d63c~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_33970b72e7804beba3e2837e1098d63c~mv2.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'wigs', 'wavy', true, true, 22, false, false, 4.4, 31),
