  ('CARAMEL CRUSH RAW HUMAN HAIR WIG STRAIGHT', 'caramel-crush-raw-human-hair-wig-straight', 'Caramel Crush Wig – My Extensions KenyaFall in love with effortless beauty. Our Caramel Crush Wig features rich caramel tones blended seamlessly for a soft, sun-kissed glow. Crafted from raw human hair, this luxurious wig offers a natural look, silky texture, and versatile styling options. Whether worn sleek or with waves, Caramel Crush enhances your glow with timeless elegance. Perfect for everyd', 73120, 73448, '["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_e9679083ebac4dd7a6b0573cd8429bc5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_e9679083ebac4dd7a6b0573cd8429bc5~mv2.jpg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_e9679083ebac4dd7a6b0573cd8429bc5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_e9679083ebac4dd7a6b0573cd8429bc5~mv2.jpg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_9a639d79e77a484fb09ee9f4bf677af7~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_9a639d79e77a484fb09ee9f4bf677af7~mv2.png"]'::jsonb, 'wigs', 'straight', true, true, 6, false, false, 4.2, 69),
  ('CASABLANCA RAW HUMAN HAIR WIG WAVY', 'casablanca-raw-human-hair-wig-wavy', 'CASABLANCA – Jet Black. Sultry. Timeless.Channel pure sophistication with the Casablanca Jet Black Raw Human Hair Wig — a sultry, jet-black masterpiece that redefines elegance and depth. Crafted from premium raw human hair, this wig’s silky texture and dark radiance evoke timeless allure and cinematic grace.Perfect for evenings when you want to make an unforgettable impression — Casablanca is for ', 84121, 84498, '["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_c9bbf8dfa00a4b81ba0c54971240ff60~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_c9bbf8dfa00a4b81ba0c54971240ff60~mv2.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'wigs', 'wavy', true, true, 24, false, false, 4.0, 52),
  ('KIGALI RAW HUMAN HAIR WIG', 'kigali-raw-human-hair-wig', 'Discover refined beauty with the Kigali Raw Human Hair Wig - a lustrous, sophisticated masterpiece crafted for the woman who values elegance and simplicity. Made from luxury raw human hair, this wig offers a smooth, polished texture that flows effortlessly with every move.Kigali captures the essence of timeless grace - understated yet unforgettable.💫 Part of The Afrique Collection — Kigali is desi', 58109, 58370, '["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_2a5e5234b4e044698ed22e33c1ed4fd7~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_2a5e5234b4e044698ed22e33c1ed4fd7~mv2.jpeg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_2a5e5234b4e044698ed22e33c1ed4fd7~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_2a5e5234b4e044698ed22e33c1ed4fd7~mv2.jpeg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/413b48_b56e68151ffe42189a439fa55f80fe57~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/413b48_b56e68151ffe42189a439fa55f80fe57~mv2.jpeg"]'::jsonb, 'wigs', NULL, true, true, 20, false, false, 3.9, 18),
